I've got new Chilling Adventures of Sabrina
videos coming up, so tap left to watch the

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.300
next one or tap right for another video you're
sure to like.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.850
If you enjoyed this, I really appreciate a
thumbs-up and a share!

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.930
Thanks for watching and see ya next time.

